{"id":"cc181bc37a9aa393","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-bitheoryexist.md","title":"Nearest-sample classification constructs a bi-theory for nonempty data","display":"thm-bitheoryexist — Nearest-sample classification constructs a bi-theory for nonempty data","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-bitheoryexist","aliases":["27-thm-bitheoryexist"],"display":"thm-bitheoryexist — Nearest-sample classification constructs a bi-theory for nonempty data","depends_on":["[[27-df-bitheory]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.2.4 Theorem 12.6","source_printed_pages":"525–526","source_pdf_pages":"549–550","verification_status":"source-proof-checked-with-explicit-empty-data-boundary","local_review_status":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-bitheoryexist"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-bitheoryexist</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-bitheoryexist — Nearest-sample classification constructs a bi-theory for nonempty data"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"591d2dd45b17cf85\" href=\"?note=591d2dd45b17cf85\" title=\"27-df-bitheory\">27-df-bitheory</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.2.4 Theorem 12.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"525–526"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"549–550"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-proof-checked-with-explicit-empty-data-boundary"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\">\\(T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\cap F=\\emptyset\">\\(T\\cap F=\\emptyset\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\cup F\\ne\\emptyset\">\\(T\\cup F\\ne\\emptyset\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BiTheory}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BiTheory}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"591d2dd45b17cf85\" href=\"?note=591d2dd45b17cf85\" title=\"27-df-bitheory\">27-df-bitheory</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_H:\\mathbb B^n\\times\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(d_H:\\mathbb B^n\\times\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:\\mathbb B^n\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B^n)\\to\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\">\\(d:\\mathbb B^n\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B^n)\\to\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\)</span> 由下式构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min\\emptyset=\\infty\">\\(\\min\\emptyset=\\infty\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span> 大于每个自然数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_*:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(f_*:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"d_H(x,y)\\coloneqq|\\{i\\in[n]\\mid x_i\\ne y_i\\}|\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[d_H(x,y)\\coloneqq|\\{i\\in[n]\\mid x_i\\ne y_i\\}|\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"d(x,U)\\coloneqq\\min\\{d_H(x,u)\\mid u\\in U\\}\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ U\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[d(x,U)\\coloneqq\\min\\{d_H(x,u)\\mid u\\in U\\}\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ U\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f_*(x)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}1&amp;d(x,T)\\le d(x,F),\\\\0&amp;d(x,T)&gt;d(x,F).\\end{cases}\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f_*(x)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}1&amp;d(x,T)\\le d(x,F),\\\\0&amp;d(x,T)&gt;d(x,F).\\end{cases}\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f_*\\in\\mathrm{BiTheory}_n(T,F),\\qquad\\mathrm{BiTheory}_n(T,F)\\ne\\emptyset.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f_*\\in\\mathrm{BiTheory}_n(T,F),\\qquad\\mathrm{BiTheory}_n(T,F)\\ne\\emptyset.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 12.6，印刷 pp.525–526／PDF pp.549–550。对每个判真x取最近真样本a，把x与a共有的文字合成项；判假y同样取最近假样本b。距离比较保证这两项至少有一对互补文字：在a、b不同的坐标上，真侧至少占一半a文字，假侧严格超过一半b文字。因而所有真侧项避开全部判假点，反向亦然；两份DNF分别表示f*及其补。若仅一侧非空，常函数与空项给相同结论。点距离记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_H\">\\(d_H\\)</span>、点到集合的距离记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>，避免零元空向量与空集同为集合论空对象时，同名二元调用分别返回0和∞的类型冲突。原书陈述未单列数据非空条件；其最近样本构造在双空样本时无最近点。本目录允许双空样本而pattern须命中样本，此时两份理论均恒0、不能互补，故明确加入T∪F非空，未无条件照抄存在式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-bitheory","status":"resolved","id":"591d2dd45b17cf85","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-bitheory]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-bitheory","status":"resolved","id":"591d2dd45b17cf85","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$，$T\\cap F=\\emptyset$、$T\\cup F\\ne\\emptyset$；$\\mathrm{BiTheory}_n$ 见 [[27-df-bitheory]]。$d_H:\\mathbb B^n\\times\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb N$ 与 $d:\\mathbb B^n\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B^n)\\to\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}$ 由下式构造；$\\min\\emptyset=\\infty$，$\\infty$ 大于每个自然数。$f_*:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B$ 由下式定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"T\\cap F=\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"T\\cup F\\ne\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BiTheory}_n","display":false},{"tex":"d_H:\\mathbb B^n\\times\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"d:\\mathbb B^n\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B^n)\\to\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\min\\emptyset=\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"f_*:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"d_H(x,y)\\coloneqq|\\{i\\in[n]\\mid x_i\\ne y_i\\}|\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n).","display":true},{"tex":"d(x,U)\\coloneqq\\min\\{d_H(x,u)\\mid u\\in U\\}\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ U\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n).","display":true},{"tex":"f_*(x)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}1&d(x,T)\\le d(x,F),\\\\0&d(x,T)>d(x,F).\\end{cases}\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n).","display":true},{"tex":"f_*\\in\\mathrm{BiTheory}_n(T,F),\\qquad\\mathrm{BiTheory}_n(T,F)\\ne\\emptyset.","display":true},{"tex":"d_H","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false}],"bytes":2565,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-bitheoryexist|thm-bitheoryexist — Nearest-sample classification constructs a bi-theory for nonempty data]]"}],"outgoing":["591d2dd45b17cf85"]}